    <p class="lead">What PATV collects, why, who can see it, how long we keep it and what you can do about it. The short version: we collect what we need to run a community site and keep it safe, we don't sell your data, there are no ads or third-party trackers, and the private abuse data on posts is admin-only and deleted on a schedule.</p>
