    <h2>9. How long we keep things</h2>
    <div class="tw"><table>
      <thead><tr><th>Data</th><th>Kept for</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Raw IP address and user agent on posts and comments</td><td>90 days, then deleted automatically (daily)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Rest of the post / comment safety record (hashes, language, country, account age, linked status)</td><td>365 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Log of admin views of safety data</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Welcome-bonus network hashes</td><td>90 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Mirrored Camfrog room chat and transcripts on the website</td><td>The latest 200 items per Camfrog room</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Pepe's snaps and clips (stories)</td><td>24 hours by default</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Files of deleted posts</td><td>Purged 7 days after deletion; the post's record may be kept for moderation and legal reasons</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Reports and moderation records</td><td>As long as needed to handle repeat abuse and legal obligations</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Live cam video</td><td>Never stored - it's relayed live only</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Who opened your cam on the website</td><td>7 days; staff moderation views 180 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Requests to watch your cam and your answers</td><td>30 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Inbox notices</td><td>Your latest 1,000</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Browser notification subscriptions, and the record of notifications sent (kind and time, never the text)</td><td>Until you turn them off, sign that browser out or the browser drops the subscription; the record 3 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Direct messages</td><td>Until the sender deletes them ("message deleted"). Clearing or deleting a conversation removes it from your view only; the other person keeps their copy. A reported message's copy is kept with the report as a moderation record</td></tr>
